WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:19.960
Oppressive heat and dampness.

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:23.420
Jungle disease and deadly insects.

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:27.380
It may have been painted in tones of green...

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:30.000
but this was definitely another province of Hell.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.830
But, to me, after dodging death and my pursuers...

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:38.880
for the three months since I left Uoodo...

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:44.250
the war-torn kingdom of Kummen
seemed like Heaven.

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:48.000
God, it's been four hours.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.630
And we're still 80 klicks out from Niitan.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.330
Why do we have to go by boat?

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:56.380
The transport plane isn't available.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:00.000
Hell of a way to run a war.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.830
I never shoulda signed up!

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.750
You can get off any time.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.330
Too late now.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:19.250
The Veela guerillas!

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:21.080
Why, those...

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.040
Stay down! They're on the other bank, too!

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:29.960
Outta the way!

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:45.500
All right!

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:56.380
Assemble EX-10

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:09.540
This isn't a good sign, Rochina.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.580
The tracking system went down
about 12 hours ago.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:17.040
We lost track of him, and when it came back up...

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:21.750
He'd fled into the kingdom of Kummen.

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:28.670
The kingdom's a fully autonomous region in a
state of open war with our federal government.

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:30.000
What do you plan to do?

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.460
There's nothing we really can do.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.420
However, Kummen's stability is uncertain at best.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:40.170
I doubt Chirico's stay there will be a long one.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.290
In other words, we wait.

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:43.330
Yes, sir.

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:46.500
For now, at least.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.630
ASSEMBLE EX-10

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:40.920
Next, number 85.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:44.130
You. Put this on your chest and
go to #5 for vaccination.

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:46.580
Next, number 86.

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.080
Number 85.

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.130
Quiet!

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:13.580
I said pipe down!

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:19.500
I am Captain Kan Yu,
and you're under my charge now!

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:23.330
If you have any problems or demands,
you bring 'em to me.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:29.880
And now, a little lesson from Assemble EX-10's
commander, General Gon Nu.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:31.210
Pay attention!

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:49.960
I have no instructions to you outside of the fact
that as mercenaries, you fight for money.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:53.000
However, I will say one thing.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:57.540
Each week, 5% of our troops never make it back.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:03.250
Whether or not you're in that 5% is up to you.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.460
Never forget, this is Hell.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:15.460
Those who have been examined must verify
their numbers and proceed to their barracks.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:18.580
Your daily necessities and uniforms
will be provided.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:25.080
Captain, we picked up something
on the X-ray before.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.170
Number 85?

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.000
Chirico?

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.920
Chirico, is that you?

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:51.250
Gotho?

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:53.380
I thought it was you!

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:57.290
Knew you'd come here sooner or later.

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:00.330
So, where've you been
since we split up in Uoodo?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.460
In Zakui?

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:06.130
Most soldiers here get roped into this in Eegio.

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.420
Well, you could say that...

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.460
Lemme see your face! Come on!

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:14.420
You haven't changed a bit!

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:21.040
You seem to be doing well here.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:25.290
Do I? My luck here in Kummen's
turned me middle-class!

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:28.000
Anyway, let's see where we can
dump your luggage.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:30.460
We can talk after that. What's your number?

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:34.540
85? Your room's this way!

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.380
Well? Impressive, isn't it?

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:49.130
I'm the exclusive dealer
for all the weaponry here.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:54.500
All those black market connections I had paid off.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:03.290
This new model can operate
underwater for two hours.

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:05.750
So, you want one for your own?

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:07.960
No, thanks. I'll use one I'm used to.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.500
Can you modify it for me?

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:11.790
Is number 85 in here?

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.210
Number 85?

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:16.710
That's me.

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:18.710
All right, you're under arrest. Come with me!

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.210
What's going on? Who ordered this?

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:24.170
Just stay out of it!

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.830
Chirico Cuvie. Resistance is useless.

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:43.420
You've got a discipline problem
with your men, Kan Yu.

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:45.170
Well, well... Mr. Gotho.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:47.330
What do you want with this man?

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:49.880
We think he's a Melkian spy!

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.580
We've got proof, Chirico.

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:55.790
You have a tracking beacon
implanted inside your body!

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.000
A beacon?

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.380
Removed, sir.

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:20.580
Get out.

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:37.460
Thought you could put one
over on us, Melkian dog?

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:39.670
Let me explain!

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:40.790
Don't play dumb!

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:45.790
That was a satellite tracking beacon
we just took outta you!

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:52.380
Now I get it.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.040
I want you to tell me everything!

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:59.380
You don't want to,
I can try asking your body directly!

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:04.420
Oh, a tough guy?

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:06.500
Well, I won't take it easy on you!

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:08.880
I told you to stay out!

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:13.790
General!

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:23.630
So, because you went on this secret mission,
the Melkian military's been after you, huh?

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:24.880
That's right.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:29.290
So why would they do all this
when you hardly know anything?

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.630
I saw a PS.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:38.380
A PS? What the hell are you talking about?

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:40.040
Kan Yu, back off!

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:42.250
But sir, this guy's...!

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:48.210
The Melkian army actually completed a PS?

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.960
I only saw one, but...

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:55.000
I see.

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:05.630
General, what's a PS?

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:07.750
A perfect soldier!

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:10.130
Perfect in every way.

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:11.580
How?

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.170
You don't know about them?

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:18.790
Neuro-enhanced super-soldiers
with improved combat ability.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.500
Well, then why didn't you say so?

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.630
I was looking for someone with half a clue.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:33.000
Chirico, tell me everything
you know about the PS.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:37.210
From the outside it appears to be
an ordinary human.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:39.170
Its gender is female.

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:40.460
That's all I know.

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:44.330
Is that really all you know?

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:46.380
Very well.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:50.000
I'll accept you aren't a Melkian spy for now.

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.170
But sir, he's still hiding something!

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:56.040
We can ask him later.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:58.290
He's not going anywhere.

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:18.130
That general's a real character, don't you think?

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:21.880
He seems to know a lot about Perfect Soldiers.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:26.790
Yeah... Just watch out for Kan Yu.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:29.920
That guy'll hang onto your ass like a leech.

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:33.170
By the way, where are we going?

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:36.750
To booze and women. Soldiers need to relax.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.420
What more do you need?

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:40.210
Look, your comrades.

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:46.630
Not my style.

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:49.710
I know.

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:53.420
But there's something I want to show you.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.000
The Fantom Club?

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:37.210
Come on in.

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:47.170
Yo, Pops! You're in early tonight.

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:51.380
Chirico!

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:53.290
Chirico, is that you?!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:55.460
Vanilla!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:15:00.040
Chirico! Gotho was right after all!

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:03.380
You finally came.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.790
You old dog!

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:07.880
And you're not a ghost, either.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.130
Hey! Coconna! Coconna!

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:12.290
Coconna's here, too?

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:16.880
Chirico!

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:23.580
Chirico, it's really you!

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:26.170
You look very pretty.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:28.880
You mean it, Chirico?

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.960
Oh, you're just saying that.

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.420
Still, I like it!

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:34.250
Come on, calm down.

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:35.210
Chirico!

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:38.250
Can we sit down? He just got here.

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:41.580
So, what'll you have? Alcohol?
We've got everything.

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:43.170
Just coffee, please.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.630
You haven't changed a bit!

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.500
Cool club, isn't it? I'm the owner.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.500
Except I paid for it.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.710
Okay, co-owner.

00:15:57.580 --> 00:15:59.210
I don't much care for the name.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:01.540
Oh, stop that.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:04.130
You'll get used to it soon enough.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:09.420
What? You still haven't forgotten about her?

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:12.290
Or did you come here after that society?

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:13.290
No!

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:19.000
I just came here to forget about all that.

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:21.830
Hallelujah!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.130
I've been waiting to hear those words!

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:41.580
You haven't even had any
and you're already giggly.

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:44.540
C'mon, what's so funny?

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:47.460
Who's in charge here?

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:49.420
Right here!

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:52.040
I'm the manager. Is there a problem?

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:54.750
Have you forgotten the orders?

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:57.460
No lights or music after 17:00 hours.

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:59.460
Don't forget where you are!

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:01.000
Yeah, well...

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:05.040
We were just about to do it,
Captain Kan Yu, sir.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:07.880
I'm co-owner of this place, you see.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:13.080
Gotho? You should know how bad
the Veela guerillas can be.

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:17.040
You...

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:21.960
They assigned you to my team.

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:25.500
I'll be showing you
just how nasty the Veela can be.

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:29.710
Better prepare yourself.

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:35.380
The Veela!

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:39.670
Air raid!

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:47.580
All Assemble forces, return to base now!

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.130
You, too!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:50.500
Chirico!

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:58.500
See you later!

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:26.080
All fighters, scramble at once!

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:27.750
Scramble at once!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:35.500
Set com freq to 80 MHz!

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:38.250
Confirm your energy level is at full charge!

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:39.710
Check!

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:40.920
Move out!

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.630
The enemy is 10 klicks north of Niitan.

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:58.580
Smash those missile launchers!

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.920
We're dropping down.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.880
As soon as we get close,
find cover and stand by.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:21.670
Roger!

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:22.380
Roger!

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:55.080
Twelve... No, thirteen.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:59.250
Chirico! Move forward and take care of them!

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:00.750
Just me, sir?

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:04.920
Of course. I want you to see
how tough the Veela are.

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:43.250
Captain, they're moving!

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:44.040
Not yet.

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:45.630
But Chirico's in trouble!

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:47.040
Stay back.

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:11.000
What the...?

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:12.170
We're surrounded!

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:14.630
Let's get out of here!

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:48.790
Hurry up and kill it!

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:06.000
It has to be!

00:22:09.380 --> 00:22:10.960
Stop it! Stop!

00:22:20.580 --> 00:22:21.330
Stop it!

00:22:22.710 --> 00:22:23.790
It's me!

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:41.960
In that instant, I knew for certain.

00:22:42.330 --> 00:22:45.920
Its reaction time was too low
to be a normal human's.

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:48.170
The one I was fighting had to be her.

00:22:48.670 --> 00:22:50.460
The woman I'd lost at Uoodo.

00:22:50.460 --> 00:22:51.960
My Fyana.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:58.330
Running deep through the darkness of space...

00:22:58.330 --> 00:23:00.080
winding past a destroyed city...

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:02.000
and struggling through the mud of chaos...

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:04.790
a thread stands out bright and clear.

00:23:05.130 --> 00:23:07.630
But for what purpose does this thread exist?

00:23:08.210 --> 00:23:10.500
Tracing it back draws
disparate destinies together.

00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:13.380
But to what end do these destinies lead?

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:16.880
In tropical Kummen,
the second act of our drama begins.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:18.960
Next time, "Doubts"

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:21.790
The puppetmasters have yet to appear.

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:24.290
Doubts

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Samishii toki mo

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Kanashii toki mo

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
Itsumo anata ga me ni ukabu

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Hitori no toki mo

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Aitai toki mo

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
Itsumo anata wa mune no naka

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
Tooku hanarete itemo

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
Tatoe wakarete itemo

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
Kono yo no hikari to tomo ni mabushiku

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Ano hi no anata ga...
